      "text": "Notes:\nIf you experience poor playback performance, adjust the resolution to a lower setting. 2. Audio and video streams are decoded by software. The audio and video subsystems need to be fully functional and enabled. 3. WinDVD does not enable DVD playback feature through Windows Media Player. After installing WinDVD, DVD video may play back through Media Player, but audio will not.",
